{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "主", "id": "主"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "尊", "id": "尊"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "相", "id": "相"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "遠", "id": "遠"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.39002408106403, "source": "悅", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 1.6554230256759237, "source": "悅", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.409194828052304, "source": "主", "target": "治"}, {"weight": 2.6968769005040847, "source": "主", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 3.1023420086122493, "source": "主", "target": "遠"}, {"weight": 3.6777061535158113, "source": "親", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 2.8304082931286074, "source": "親", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.2499579175677593, "source": "親", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.984558972955866, "source": "親", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 1.6264354888026713, "source": "至", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.2358734012367716, "source": "至", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 1.095807237740501, "source": "至", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.8304082931286074, "source": "至", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 2.137261112568662, "source": "至", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 2.137261112568662, "source": "至", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.4441139320087168, "source": "至", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 2.6968769